== Explanations

#sol-item(1, "A", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Belonging and supportive relationships are aspects of social wellbeing.]

#sol-item(2, "B", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Facilities and supplies are needed to put knowledge into practice.]

#sol-item(3, "D", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Universal cure claims need careful evaluation and do not replace professional advice.]

#sol-item(4, "C", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Protein supplies amino acids used in growth and tissue maintenance.]

#sol-item(5, "B", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Seven grams per serving multiplied by three servings gives 21 g.]

#sol-item(6, "D", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Microorganisms can transfer from raw meat to ready-to-eat food via unwashed equipment.]

#sol-item(7, "C", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Individual circumstances and treatment requirements differ.]

#sol-item(8, "D", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Antibiotics work against susceptible bacteria, not viruses causing common colds.]

#sol-item(9, "D", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Unresponsiveness and abnormal breathing are emergencies requiring urgent help.]

#sol-item(10, "A", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Accumulated smoke can expose occupants to harmful pollutants.]

#sol-item(11, "C", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Appearance does not establish water safety, and boiling does not remove all chemical contamination.]

#sol-item(12, "A", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Sanitation includes safe containment, maintenance, treatment and disposal.]

#sol-item(13, "A", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Malaria is caused by Plasmodium parasites and commonly transmitted by infected female Anopheles mosquitoes.]

#sol-item(14, "B", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Treated nets help reduce mosquito bites and malaria risk when used appropriately.]

#sol-item(15, "C", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[HIV is not spread by ordinary social contact such as hugging and sharing food.]

#sol-item(16, "C", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Infectious pulmonary TB can spread through airborne particles.]

#sol-item(17, "D", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Diabetes is an NCD; the others are infectious diseases.]

#sol-item(18, "B", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Risk concerns probability and does not establish certainty or diagnosis.]

#sol-item(19, "B", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Respectful listening and access to suitable support can help.]

#sol-item(20, "A", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Sudden neurological symptoms can indicate an emergency.]

#sol-item(21, "A", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Scene safety protects the responder while urgent help is arranged.]

#sol-item(22, "B", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Firm direct pressure can help control severe bleeding while emergency help is arranged.]

#sol-item(23, "D", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Cool running water is recommended; avoid ice and do not remove stuck material.]

#sol-item(24, "C", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Keep the injured area still and seek appropriate assessment; do not force alignment.]

#sol-item(25, "C", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Call emergency services and follow dispatcher instructions for CPR and AED use.]

#sol-item(26, "D", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Consent is voluntary and can be withdrawn.]

#sol-item(27, "B", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Condoms reduce many STI risks, but may not cover all exposed skin.]

#sol-item(28, "B", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Many contraceptives prevent pregnancy but do not protect against STIs; discuss the two questions separately.]

#sol-item(29, "D", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Development and timing vary among individuals.]

#sol-item(30, "C", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Unwanted contact is not the affected person's fault; support and safety are important.]

#sol-item(31, "C", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Function, accessibility and maintenance help show whether an intervention is usable.]

#sol-item(32, "A", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[CDC guidance recommends sanitizer containing at least 60% alcohol when soap and water are unavailable.]

#sol-item(33, "A", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[A vector transmits an infectious agent; the pathogen and vector are distinct.]

#sol-item(34, "C", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Appearance does not establish food safety.]

#sol-item(35, "D", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Contraceptive options differ and should be considered in context.]

#sol-item(36, "D", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[WHO states that people with a sustained undetectable viral load do not sexually transmit HIV.]

#sol-item(37, "B", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Removing an embedded object can worsen bleeding; seek help and apply pressure around it.]

#sol-item(38, "A", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Risk factors affect probability and do not prove individual causation.]

#sol-item(39, "A", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Waste needs appropriate separation, collection, treatment and disposal.]

#sol-item(40, "B", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Study material supports learning but does not replace individual assessment or emergency care.]
